        [424785] = "Viciously slash an enemy for $s2% weapon damage, and cause the target to bleed for ${$AP*$m4/100} damage every $t4 sec for $d, stacking up to $u times. Each stack also increases damage done by your Saber Slash and Sinister Strike by $s5%. Awards $s3 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nSaber Slash benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike.",
        [424788] = "Salvage the wreckage of a shredder for spare parts.",
        [424799] = "Instantly attack with your off-hand weapon to deal normal off-hand weapon damage with a 100% chance to apply the poison from your off-hand weapon to the target. Slower weapons require more energy. Awards $s2 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nShiv benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike.",
        [424800] = "Instantly attack with your off-hand weapon with a 100% chance to apply the poison from your off-hand weapon to the target. Slower weapons require more energy. Awards $s2 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n",
        [424919] = "Instantly strike with your off-hand weapon for normal off-hand weapon damage and increase your chance to parry by $s2% for $d or until you successfully parry. For $462752d after using Main Gauche, Sinister Strike costs $462752s1 less Energy, deals $462752s2% more threat, grants stacks of Rolling with the Punches, and both Sinister Strike and Eviscerate deal $462752s3% more damage. Awards $s3 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nMain Gauche benefits from most talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike. Main Gauche's effect will not discount or empower Main Gauche.",
        [424925] = "Reduces the Energy cost of your Backstab and Ambush abilities by $s1, and increases the damage they deal to non-player controlled targets by $s2%. $?s400094[Does not apply to Mutilate.][Does not apply to abilities learned from other runes.]",
